	text: [
		"You have angered §6Nature§r, and as a result lost some §6privilges§r. ",
		"",
		"Nature is forgiving, and with the right offerings can be persuaded to §6forgive you§r. ",
		"",
		"In order to do this, place an §6offering table§r near a §6tamed§r spirit tree §6mask§r, and place a §6spirit fruit§r onto the table. ",
		"",
		"§6Sneak§r and wait for the process to finish. ",
		"",
		"§4Be aware that this will not only consume the spirit fruit, but also 10% of your maximum life, permanently!§r"
